  unitName: Glacier Twin-Blade Colt
  unitId: 20576
  unitNumber: 888
  description: When Colt received word that a group of dissenters sought to destroy
    the Holy Emperor, he asked his partners to return to Grand Gaia with him. However,
    the group split up into factions, and only him, his sister, and Fadahl went back.
    Once home, Colt battled against those who meant to slay Karna Masta, but exhausted
    from his previous mission, soon found himself unable to release his full power.
    It is said that Claire fell trying to protect her brother, leaving her last words
    to him. However, he had already been at peace when he heard them, and never moved
    again.
  summonDesc: What do you think of me?<br>I'm neither strong, nor kind.<br>I'm just
    a weakling...
  fusionDesc: Now I'll fight for you because<br>you've acknowledged my strength.<br>I'll
    keep pressing forward too.
  evoDesc: I don't need anything else.<br>Power nor kindness.<br>Yet, I still find
    myself here.
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
